tion</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lm}\">\\(\\mathrm{lm}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{lm}\">\\(\\mathsf{lm}\\)</span> 为同一最左策略标签。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.2}\\vdash\n\\alpha\\Rightarrow_G\\beta\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists(A,\\gamma)\\in P\\;\\exists u,v\\in(V\\cup T)^*\\;(\\alpha=uAv\\land\\beta=u\\gamma v)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.2}\\vdash\n\\alpha\\Rightarrow_G\\beta\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists(A,\\gamma)\\in P\\;\\exists u,v\\in(V\\cup T)^*\\;(\\alpha=uAv\\land\\beta=u\\gamma v)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.2}\\vdash\n\\alpha\\Rightarrow_G^*\\beta\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\to(V\\cup T)^*\\;\n(\\rho(0)=\\alpha\\land\\rho(n)=\\beta\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\;\\rho(i)\\Rightarrow_G\\rho(i+1))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.2}\\vdash\n\\alpha\\Rightarrow_G^*\\beta\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\to(V\\cup T)^*\\;\n(\\rho(0)=\\alpha\\land\\rho(n)=\\beta\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\;\\rho(i)\\Rightarrow_G\\rho(i+1))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.2}\\vdash\n\\alpha\\Rightarrow_{G,\\mathrm{lm}}\\beta\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists(A,\\gamma)\\in P\\;\\exists u\\in T^*\\;\\exists v\\in(V\\cup T)^*\\;\n(\\alpha=uAv\\land\\beta=u\\gamma v)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.2}\\vdash\n\\alpha\\Rightarrow_{G,\\mathrm{lm}}\\beta\\leftrig